{"id":"vod_sn_36126","vodId":"36126","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"钢之炼金术师FA","name_cn":"钢之炼金术师FA","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/74b5adc4817ed1b323a727332bd78f40.jpg"},"summary":"炼金术，一种建立在等价交换原则基础上的科学，将物质进行理解、分解、再构造，将一种物品变成另外一种。但是，这样先进的技术却不能进行人体炼成，这是炼金术绝对的禁忌。可是，拥有极高炼金术天赋的爱德华（朴璐美 配音）和阿尔冯斯（钉宫理恵 配音）兄弟，因为对母亲极大的思念不惜触犯禁忌。而最终的代价却是，爱德华失去了一条手臂和一条腿，弟弟阿尔冯斯只能将灵魂依附在一副巨大的装甲之内。终于明白一切的兄弟俩，为了恢复原状，寻求更多的炼金术知识，成为国家炼金术师踏上了寻找终极炼金物品——贤者之石的旅程。在不断的探索中，两兄弟终于发现了贤者之石背后的真相，对身处的这个军事化国家也有了更深入的了解。此时，面对国家、民族、家庭……炼金术的未来究竟在何处。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uyqUhAqXtj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sQ7Ki8RBTN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/27XM7CMJLN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eDFqLXBi1z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/K0402Zm1AQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QGBatuVUSM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NKMYbjzFNm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9EFPzYV6Vt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sSyPzQWxiB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tNQHcTyrP51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ByRw2pQB101/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CXAWLQNWJC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zbCLYf2PRS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vDd7CYn